WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.932 --> 00:00:04.347
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:04.347 --> 00:00:07.440
NARRATOR: Marvel's Avengers is
a third person action adventure

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.590
game featuring an all new
original story where you

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:11.670
play as your favorite Avengers.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.810
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:17.750
The story starts on A day
at the opening celebration

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.870
of the Avengers west
coast headquarters

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:22.360
and the reveal of the team's
new tarragon crystal reactor.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.890
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.590
But after being blamed for
a disastrous explosion that

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.960
leaves San Francisco
in ruins, the Avengers

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.450
are forced to disband
due to public backlash

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.720
and government pressure.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:37.730
In their absence,
a new organization

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:41.660
rises vowing to protect the
world, Advanced Idea Mechanics,

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:44.660
otherwise known as AIM.

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:49.370
Five years later, the world
is a very different place.

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:52.100
In their pursuit of a safer
future through science,

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.570
AIM has replaced
superhumans with

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.430
their advanced synthoid AI.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:56.690
 That was the question.

00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:58.370
NARRATOR: But under
the surface, the signs

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.020
of a conspiracy against
heroes begins to unfold.

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.890
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:06.590
With all Super Heroes
outlawed, an Avengers fan girl

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:09.530
from New Jersey named Kamala
Khan embarks on a quest

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:11.600
to prove her heroes'
innocence and become

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.030
who she was destined to be.

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:16.220
Kamala plays a central
role as the catalyst

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:18.800
to reassemble the team
with her unique perspective

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:21.140
and incredible powers.

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:23.240
Only together can
the Avengers overcome

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:26.060
the dangers in this new world.

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:28.580
You'll start by establishing
a base of operations

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:30.620
in a decommissioned
helicarrier, which gets

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:32.980
upgraded throughout the story.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.890
You can customize your heroes
to play solo or assemble

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:38.050
online with your
friends defending earth

00:01:38.050 --> 00:01:40.960
from ever escalating threats.

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:43.480
Each of the heroes has
tons of outfits inspired

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:46.180
by over 80 years
of Marvel history,

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:49.760
as well as original new ones.

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:53.380
As you play, you'll
earn an unlock gear,

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:56.180
equip different gear pieces
to customize your playstyle

00:01:56.180 --> 00:01:58.220
and become even more powerful.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:01.010
Power up gear by unlocking
perks which will change

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:03.090
the way you play the game.

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:05.930
Unlock skills and abilities
as you earn experience

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:07.595
and build your heroes
to fit your playstyle.

00:02:07.595 --> 00:02:10.210
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:02:10.210 --> 00:02:12.310
Using the war table,
you can launch into two

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:14.060
different types of missions.

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:17.110
Hero missions are the single
player campaign experiences

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:19.360
showcasing specific heroes.

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.100
And war zone missions,
which are played

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:24.820
solo or online with up to
a total of four players.

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:26.730
All missions drive
the narrative forward.

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:28.210
And all of your
heroes progress is

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:29.770
shared across the entire game.

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:32.698
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:44.220
Reassemble the Avengers and
rebuild the team to be Earth's

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:47.150
Mightiest Heroes once again.

